# Both entries below are false positives from the same source: pip's own
# bundled site-packages/pip/_vendor/bom.cdx.json, a static CycloneDX SBOM
# describing the provenance of pip's vendored libraries at the version pip
# was built with -- not an installed package. Verified via `find`/`grep`
# across the built image for each: the only version actually installed is
# the fixed one in both cases.

# setuptools 70.3.0 in bom.cdx.json; installed version is 84.0.0 (fixed).
CVE-2025-47273

# msgpack 1.1.2 in bom.cdx.json; installed version is 1.2.2 (fixed, pinned
# in requirements.txt).
